1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,820
The Ruy Lopez begins with pressure on the e pawn.

2
00:00:03,900 --> 00:00:07,720
Black develops the knight and offers a central pawn.

3
00:00:07,800 --> 00:00:11,620
White castles while Black takes the pawn.

4
00:00:11,700 --> 00:00:15,520
The rook moves to the open file with a direct threat.

5
00:00:15,600 --> 00:00:19,420
Black builds a center before the knight can escape.

6
00:00:19,500 --> 00:00:23,320
White takes, but Black's bishop gains the tempo back.

7
00:00:23,400 --> 00:00:27,220
The lesson: a pawn grab can unlock the opponent's center.
